    #    ODOO035, ODOO048 and ODOO059) run from the autofix configuration instead (see .ruff-autofix.toml)
    #  - ODOO008 (manifest-required-author) and ODOO010 (license-allowed) keep running from
    #    pylint-odoo since ruff-odoo doesn't support yet configuring the Vauxoo authors (Vauxoo,
    #    Jarsa) nor the OPL-1 license (see the [ODOOLINT] section in .pylintrc-optional)
    #  - Version-dependent gating is handled by ruff-odoo's internal logic when --odoo-version
    #    is passed to ruff; all version-scoped checks are always enabled here and ruff filters them
